{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000e0b9","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a06ed9-7c63-74b3-b8db-139ac4482e30"},"sequence":3767,"recorded_at":1780531400007529,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"680c30af-893a-4c96-ab8b-878d612e53c6","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"680c30af-893a-4c96-ab8b-878d612e53c6","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"680c30af-893a-4c96-ab8b-878d612e53c6"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"51f8bc47-4895-4a0f-8e5f-6447b0b74ac1"},"task_id":"51f8bc47-4895-4a0f-8e5f-6447b0b74ac1","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"51f8bc47-4895-4a0f-8e5f-6447b0b74ac1","chunk":"{\n  \"chunk_id\": \"exec-112-1\",\n  \"command\": \"date +%H%M; head -20 LOGBOOK.md\",\n  \"description\": \"Check time and logbook head\",\n  \"exit_code\": 0,\n  \"terminal_status\": \"completed\",\n  \"output\": \"0429\\n# Flight Logbook\\n\\n> Institutional memory. Concise, factual, high-signal.\\n> Newest entries first. One block per insight.\\n\\n## 2026-09-05\\n\\n### 0327 — The fourth enumeration failure: the refusal inventory could derive nothing and pass\\n\\n- SCOPE: `internal/provider` round-3 rework of TASK-260830-2890sd (findings F11–F17).\\n- FINDING: `auditRefusalInventory` derived its domain from package source, then asserted only that every derived site was exercised. Four mutants stayed green: empty domain, 1-of-N domain, skipping `provider.go` entirely, and a planted stray `Error{}` plus an empty-but-successful wrong-cwd read. The same stray alone reddened, which locates the hole precisely in the derivation, not the check. This is entry 0230's defect one level up, and the fourth recorded instance of \\\"closed the guards the review named, did not enumerate the rest\\\" — the package already carried the floor three times (`TestDiscoveryReachesNoProcess`, `TestCandidatesAdvertiseNoCapability`, the source inventory's exact counts) while the identical file-scan idiom in the refusal inventory had none.\\n- FIX: bidirectional inventory — `ScannedFiles` floor (\\\"scanned no production sources; the check is blind\\\"), empty-sites floor (\\\"derived no refusal sites; the scan is blind\\\"), and a reverse check requiring every exercised site to resolve to a derived site. The reverse bound is derived from the test run, not hand-listed, so truncation reddens without a magic number. Floors that must survive early-return mutants live at the caller (`TestSection71AdvertisesNoPublicSDK` for `exportedSymbols`); a floor inside the helper is bypassed by `return nil` at its top. `auditRefusalInventory` floors live in the audit itself, so they hold for the same reason.\\n- FINDING: the production `OSSystem` seam had zero negative tests — eight survivors in one file. Three are entry 0230's uid-0 twin on the attestation side (`Inspect` swallowing the error as uid 0, `fileOwnerUID` returning `0, nil` against its own doc comment, `CurrentOperatorPolicy` seeding `{0}`), one inverts the headline invariant at the only violable point (`ReadDir` error as absence). The `Inspect` attestation-error branch is unreachable with real stat results on unix, so it is forced through a documented `ownerAttester` variable — the only seam that makes the branch testable rather than merely readable.\\n- BOUND: `Geteuid`-vs-`Getuid` is environment-equivalent on any host where euid == uid (here `euid=502 uid=502`, probed); the test pins `OperatorUID` to the effective uid and kills the `{0}`-wildcard mutant, and the residual is recorded, not waved through. Native Windows refusal is covered by a build-tagged test compiled via `GOOS=windows go vet`, not executed here.\\n- EVIDENCE: 19-mutant harness over every rev4 survivor shape: 18 RED, 1 environment-equivalent green (G40b). `go test ./...` exit 0, provider cover 97.0%, `go vet`/`GOOS=windows go vet`/`GOOS=windows go build` clean.\\n- STATUS: Resolved. TASK-260830-2890sd round-3 rework, handed to review uncommitted per the CR-shape instruction.\\n\\n## 2026-09-04\\n\\n### 0230 — The guard the round did not sweep was the one that matters: uid 0 admitted, suite green\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 3191,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 798,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}"}}}
