{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000e0dd","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a06ed9-7c63-74b3-b8db-139ac4482e30"},"sequence":3785,"recorded_at":1780531400007565,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"680c30af-893a-4c96-ab8b-878d612e53c6","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"680c30af-893a-4c96-ab8b-878d612e53c6","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"680c30af-893a-4c96-ab8b-878d612e53c6"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"085dd63e-e636-439c-b5c2-59baecc0b92c"},"task_id":"085dd63e-e636-439c-b5c2-59baecc0b92c","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"085dd63e-e636-439c-b5c2-59baecc0b92c","chunk":"edited\nchanged lines: lines 6-8\n--- original\n+++ updated\n@@\n-## 2026-09-05\n-\n-### 0327 — The fourth enumeration failure: the refusal inventory could derive nothing and pass\n+## 2026-09-05\n+\n+### 0429 — Provider JSONL host leaf: protocol transport, three inherited findings, one repeated harness failure\n+\n+- SCOPE: TASK-260830-qcosxq (story leaf 2). New `internal/provhost` (§7.2 framing/lifecycle, §7.5 dispatch names, status recovery; bodies opaque except status rules), plus F18/F19/F20 closures in `internal/provider` and `.github/workflows/ci.yml`. Uncommitted per the CR-shape instruction.\n+- FINDING: F18 closed with the verdict's four-line pin (`ownerAttester` pointer-equals `fileOwnerUID`); SEAM1 verified red before restore. F19 closed by planting a distinct-ID candidate in each absolute dir of `TestDiscoverRefusesRelativePluginDir`; the `return out` mutant returns 1 candidate and reddens. F20 closed with a `GOOS=windows go vet ./...` CI step; a planted type error in `os_windows_test.go` verified the step sees the file.\n+- FINDING: the §7.3/§7.5 operation registry counts 15, not 16 — the manifest JSON and the §7.5 table both list manifest, probe, launch, identify-session, quiesce, native-store-plan, capture, materialize, materialize-status, materialize-commit, materialize-rollback, resume, fork, stop, doctor. The ownership gap prose saying \"16-entry\" miscounts; the registry test derives the 15 from the pinned table in order.\n+- ANOMALY: repeated entry 2113 exactly — the mutant sweep restored via `git checkout` on untracked files, silently no-opping, so mutants accumulated and every verdict after the first was taken on a red mask. Caught because later mutants stopped compiling. Recovery: byte-level reversal of every applied pair (one 2x over-replace repaired by hand), then a clean re-run with `cp` backups, per-mutant presence assertions, and restore verification.\n+- DECISION: transport lives in `internal/provhost`, not `internal/provider` — leaf 1's `TestDiscoveryReachesNoProcess` fails any `os/exec` import in the discovery package, and weakening that scan would resurrect a round-3 kill. Local failures are `*axerror.Error` via six instrumented constructors (audited bidirectionally with a closed six-code set); child failures surface through `DecodeBound` under the static provider-major-2 binding and `LocalFromUntrusted` for first-frame faults.\n+- ANOMALY: the sleep-past-deadline test exposed a real defect, not a test artifact — killing only the direct child leaves grandchildren holding the pipes, hanging the wait past the deadline. Fixed with process-group kill on unix (direct-child kill on Windows, stated) plus `WaitDelay` and stream abandonment; the test bounds elapsed time below the drain delay to pin it.\n+- BOUND: provhost cover 86.1% statements; the remainder is constructor-error propagation branches (constructors proven total by an explicit test) and `ExecRunner` stdin-failure races. Full body vocabularies and mutation idempotency receipts belong to the conformance leaf; no §7.2 clause newly discharged (`tracecheck` unchanged at 17/403, 74 cases).\n+- EVIDENCE: 25 narrowing mutants, each verified present, compiling, and restored — 25 killed, 0 survivors. `go test ./...` exit 0 (15/15), `-race` exit 0 in batches over all 15, `go vet` and `GOOS=windows go vet` exit 0, `gofmt` clean, `tracecheck` exit 0, catalog generate current.\n+- STATUS: Ready for review, handed off uncommitted.\n+\n+### 0327 — The fourth enumeration failure: the refusal inventory could derive nothing and pass\n"}}}
